requirements.detail:
Enforces strict height limits for marking characters (such as nominal size, ply rating, load index) depending on nominal rim diameter:
a) Up to 12 inches: b = 4 mm minimum, c = 4 mm minimum;
b) 13 to 19.5 inches: b = 6 mm minimum, c = 4 mm minimum;
k) 20 inches and above: b = 9 mm minimum, c = 4 mm minimum.
